# Devx screenshots accumulate at the repo root during UI walks. They are not
# packaged with the app — assets live under assets/. Stops `homey app validate`
# from copying them into .homeybuild/ where check-homey-packaging rejects them.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.gif
/*.webp
# The same walks also write whole directories of PNGs. Unlike the loose files
# above these are never rejected by check-homey-packaging (it only scans the
# build root), so without these entries they ride along into the package and
# grow it with every UI walk.
screenshots/
docs-shots/

test/
tests/
coverage/
output/
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
