# Sourcemaps and .d.ts files are NOT excluded here, deliberately. Every one of
# them lives under node_modules, and Homey installs production dependencies
# into .homeybuild/ *after* applying this file — so a `**/*.map` rule here
# matches nothing and silently ships ~2.7 MB. scripts/sanitize-homey-build.mjs
# deletes them instead; it is the only step that runs after that install.
# Treat the node_modules/ entries above the same way: they document intent and
# feed scripts/check-homeybuild-requires.mjs, but scripts/homeybuild-pruned-
# modules.mjs is what actually guarantees a package is gone.
